=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Hieronymus}
* Exit to {z:North Gustaberg (S)}, follow the wall to the east-(K-8) to find the {n:Allied Ensign}.
* Once the party leader has selected to enter, you will be transported into {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* You will come across a Soldier, who immediately runs towards a {m:Trained Scorpion} and begins attacking.
** During this time, you will see messages that display how much attention he is giving to the fight:
*** The soldier seems unfocused...
*** The soldier has begun to train harder!
*** The soldier is fighting with vigor!
* Once the {m:Trained Scorpion} defeated, the Mission Objective is complete.
** It is probably a good strategy to let the soldier tank until he is fighting with vigor, then attack the {m:Trained Scorpion}.
** If the soldier never gains focus, you lose the mission.
* Return and talk to Hieronymus for your reward.

=2 Notes
* There seems to be no time limit to how long you can take to get to {z:Ruhotz Silvermines}.
* The soldier will die if left alone, however can cure himself.
* The {m:Trained Scorpion} lasts a long while, and seems to shift hate very often.
* The {m:Trained Scorpion} seems to have around ? HP.

